{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-08-07T20:15:14.411Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Private Label Tablet Supplements | DaVinci Private Label","id":"218946510195","language":"en","layoutSections":{"main_content":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"Main Content","name":"main_content","params":{},"rowMetaData":[{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"}],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_0","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Hero","name":"module_0","params":{"align":"center","background_image":{"background_position":"MIDDLE_CENTER","background_size":"cover","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg"},"background_screen":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":85},"buttons":[{"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"#get-started","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"style":"primary","text":"Talk to Our Team"}],"eyebrow":"PRIVATE LABEL TABLETS","eyebrow_color":"heading","headline":"<h1>Launch your supplement line in tablets, customer-ready.</h1>","max_width":900,"module_id":218939846507,"section_id":"","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":90,"padding_top":90}},"subhead":"<p>Doctor-formulated supplements available in tablets format, ready to brand as your own and ship to your customers.</p>","text_color":"dark"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_1","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Rich Text","name":"module_1","params":{"align":"left","body_size":18,"content":"<h2>Why brands choose tablets as a supplement format.</h2><p>Different audiences prefer different delivery formats. Tablets are a category-leading choice when your customers want a specific combination of convenience, dosing precision, and ingredient compatibility.</p><p>With direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements, low minimums, and no set-up fees, you can quickly build a tablets-based product line that fits your audience. Below is what to know about manufacturing tablets for private label: the formulations we offer, the specs available, how we make them, and which health categories benefit most.</p>","max_width":850,"module_id":218940115784,"section_id":"","size":"normal","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#FFFFFF","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":50,"padding_top":80}},"text_color":"dark","top_border":false},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_2","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Card Grid","name":"module_2","params":{"card_align":"left","card_style":"plain","cards":[{"content":"<p>Direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements with low minimums and no set-up fees. Choose what fits your audience and your timeline.</p>","number_or_eyebrow":"01","title":"BUILD YOUR PRODUCT LINE"},{"content":"<p>Use your existing logo, customize a new label, or pick from our professional templates. Our in-house design team brings your vision to life.</p>","number_or_eyebrow":"02","title":"DESIGN YOUR BRAND"},{"content":"<p>Launch in as little as 3 to 4 weeks after approving your labels. Every product passes rigorous quality assurance before it ships.</p>","number_or_eyebrow":"03","title":"START SELLING FAST"}],"eyebrow_style":"text","gap":40,"max_width":1100,"min_column_width":260,"module_id":218940115759,"section_eyebrow":"HOW IT WORKS","section_headline":"Get to market faster with a partner who handles the heavy lifting.","section_subhead":"","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":70,"padding_top":70}},"text_color":"dark","title_style":"eyebrow-caps"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_3","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Card Grid","name":"module_3","params":{"accent_color":{"color":"#6BA644","opacity":100},"card_align":"left","card_style":"card","cards":[{"content":"<p>Tablets compress more active ingredient into a smaller pill than capsules of the same size. The right choice when your formulation requires high dosing without an oversized supplement.</p>","icon":{"alt":"","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-7389db2445.svg"},"title":"Dense dosing in a smaller footprint"},{"content":"<p>Tablets are the most cost-efficient supplement format to manufacture. When you want competitive shelf pricing or larger pack counts at a reasonable price, tablets stretch your margin further.</p>","icon":{"alt":"","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-960271aa9b.svg"},"title":"Lowest cost per dose"},{"content":"<p>Enteric coatings protect ingredients from stomach acid. Sustained-release coatings extend absorption over hours. Sugar or film coatings mask bitter actives. Pick the right coating for your formulation.</p>","icon":{"alt":"","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-ae9b4a4f61.svg"},"title":"Coating options for taste and release"}],"eyebrow_style":"text","gap":28,"icon_badge":true,"icon_badge_color":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":100},"icon_tile":true,"icon_tile_color":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":100},"max_width":1100,"min_column_width":260,"module_id":218940115759,"section_eyebrow":"ADVANTAGES","section_headline":"What makes tablets a strong supplement format.","section_subhead":"","show_accent":true,"style":{"background_color":{"color":"#f7f7f6","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":70,"padding_top":70}},"text_color":"dark","title_style":"heading"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_4","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Section Header","name":"module_4","params":{"align":"center","eyebrow":"SPECIFICATIONS","headline":"Manufacturing specs available for private label tablets.","module_id":218940115771,"section_id":"","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#FFFFFF","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":30,"padding_top":70}},"subhead":"<p>The most common questions from brand owners are about sizes, materials, fill capacity, and minimums. Here is the short answer for each.</p>","text_color":"dark"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_5","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Stat Band","name":"module_5","params":{"accent_color":{"color":"#012638","opacity":100},"align":"left","card_style":"card","gap":24,"max_width":1200,"min_column_width":240,"module_id":218940115735,"section_headline":"","stats":[{"description":"<p>Round tablets are the standard. Oval and caplet shapes are easier to swallow for higher-dose products. Custom shapes available for higher-volume orders.</p>","icon":{"alt":"Shape Options","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-7389db2445.svg"},"stat_label":"Shape Options","value":"Round, Oval, Caplet"},{"description":"<p>Uncoated, film-coated (taste masking), sugar-coated, enteric-coated (acid-resistant). Coating choice depends on your active ingredients and customer experience requirements.</p>","icon":{"alt":"Coating Types","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-ae9b4a4f61.svg"},"stat_label":"Coating Types","value":"4"},{"description":"<p>Tablets compress significantly more active per pill than capsules. Higher doses possible than other formats. Our formulators help right-size for swallowing comfort.</p>","icon":{"alt":"Active Dose Range","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-04cb8f7fc7.svg"},"stat_label":"Active Dose Range","value":"100mg - 1500mg"},{"description":"<p>Low order minimums and no set-up fees. Tablet runs are typically cost-efficient at moderate to high volume. Exact MOQ scoped during the discovery call.</p>","icon":{"alt":"Minimums &amp; Set-Up","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-681f7474d8.svg"},"stat_label":"Minimums &amp; Set-Up","value":"Low MOQ"}],"style":{"background_color":{"color":"#FFFFFF","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":80,"padding_top":80}},"text_color":"dark","value_size":28},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_6","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Content Split","name":"module_6","params":{"buttons":[],"content":"<p>Our tablet manufacturing runs on high-speed rotary presses in our FDA-registered Vermont facility. Every batch goes through ingredient identity verification, in-process hardness and disintegration testing, and finished-product testing for identity, purity, potency, and contaminants before release. Coating operations run on the same site, so your private label tablets ship customer-ready without an outside packaging handoff.</p>","eyebrow":"MANUFACTURING","gap":60,"headline":"How we manufacture tablets for private label.","image":{"alt":"Tablets manufacturing","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Tablets.jpg"},"image_radius":6,"image_shadow":false,"image_side":"left","max_width":1100,"module_id":218939846527,"ratio":"1fr 1fr","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#012638","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":90,"padding_top":90}},"text_color":"light"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_7","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - CTA Band","name":"module_7","params":{"background_screen":{"color":"#012638","opacity":0},"buttons":[{"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"#get-started","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"style":"primary","text":"Request Samples"}],"content":"<p>Want to see tablets samples or talk through your formulation?</p>","eyebrow":"","headline":"","max_width":800,"module_id":218940115731,"section_id":"","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":50,"padding_top":50}},"text_color":"dark"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_8","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Tile Grid","name":"module_8","params":{"columns":"auto","gap":24,"image_fit":"cover","image_height":160,"image_max_width":0,"min_column_width":180,"module_id":218940115743,"section_headline":"Categories where tablets shine","section_subhead":"<p>Some health categories work better in tablets than others. Here are the ones where this format is the natural choice.</p>","show_labels_over_image":false,"style":{"background_color":{"color":"#f7f7f6","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":80,"padding_top":80}},"text_color":"dark","tile_style":"card","tiles":[{"image":{"alt":"Aging","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/agingsupps.png"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"/private-label-aging","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Aging"},{"image":{"alt":"Herbal","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/herbalsupps.png"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"/private-label-herbal","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Herbal"},{"image":{"alt":"Women's Health","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/womenssupps.png"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"/private-label-womens-health","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Women's Health"},{"image":{"alt":"Sleep","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/sleepsupps.png"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"/private-label-sleep","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Sleep"},{"image":{"alt":"Fitness","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/fitnesssupps.png"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"/private-label-fitness","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Fitness"}]},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_9","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - FAQ","name":"module_9","params":{"items":[{"answer":"<p>Yes. Standard tablets use plant-derived binders and excipients, so the format is vegetarian by default. We can also formulate tablets to specific dietary positioning (vegan, kosher, halal) with appropriate ingredient sourcing.</p>","question":"Are tablets vegetarian by default?"},{"answer":"<p>Standard tablets disintegrate in the stomach. Enteric-coated tablets are designed to bypass stomach acid and release in the small intestine. Use enteric coating for ingredients that are degraded by stomach acid (some probiotics, certain enzymes) or that cause stomach upset (fish oil, some herbs).</p>","question":"What is the difference between enteric-coated and standard tablets?"},{"answer":"<p>Yes. Tablets can be manufactured with a score line so customers can split a dose in half. This is common for higher-dose products where customers may want flexibility in serving size.</p>","question":"Can tablets be scored for splitting?"},{"answer":"<p>Most tablet formulations have a 24 to 36-month shelf life depending on actives and packaging. Tablets are generally one of the most shelf-stable supplement formats due to their compressed density and low moisture content.</p>","question":"What is the typical shelf life for tablets?"},{"answer":"<p>Chewable tablets are a different formulation and process from standard tablets. They use different excipients (sugar alcohols, flavor systems, lower hardness profiles) for palatability. See our private label chewables page for more on that format.</p>","question":"Can you do chewable tablets through the same line?"}],"max_width":820,"module_id":218940115739,"open_first":false,"section_eyebrow":"","section_headline":"Tablets questions we hear most often","section_id":"","section_subhead":"<p>Quick answers to the questions brand owners ask before they commit.</p>","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#FFFFFF","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":80,"padding_top":80}},"text_color":"dark"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_10","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Tile Grid","name":"module_10","params":{"columns":"auto","gap":24,"image_fit":"contain","image_height":180,"image_max_width":180,"min_column_width":160,"module_id":218940115743,"section_headline":"Other supplement forms we offer","section_subhead":"<p>Most brands launch with two or three formats to give customers options. Here is the full list of formats we manufacture.</p>","show_labels_over_image":false,"style":{"background_color":{"color":"#f7f7f6","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":80,"padding_top":80}},"text_color":"dark","tile_style":"plain","tiles":[{"image":{"alt":"Capsules","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Capsules.jpg"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Capsules"},{"image":{"alt":"Soft Gels","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https:/